---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Sténtor Beta-Zugang - Sténtor" description="Frage den privaten Sténtor-Beta-Zugang für Theater, Kompanien, Festivals, Schulen und Institutionen an." active={null} showNav={false} showFooter={false}>
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-black text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 [background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(239,68,68,0.22)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] [-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="relative max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-7 flex items-center justify-between"><a href="/de/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-white hover:text-white/80 transition-colors"><span class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-xl">STENTOR</span><span class="text-white/45 text-sm">Beta</span></a><a href="/de/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/55 hover:text-white transition-colors"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Zurück zur Seite</a></header>
    <main class="relative max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-10 pb-20">
      <div class="mb-10"><p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-red-400 mb-4">Private Beta</p><h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.06em] font-semibold max-w-[680px]">Sténtor Beta-Zugang anfragen.</h1><p class="text-white/55 text-lg leading-[1.55] mt-6 max-w-[600px]">Frage eine Testlizenz für professionelle Live-Produktion an. Während der Beta wird jeder Zugang manuell geprüft, bevor Downloads und Aktivierungen freigegeben werden.</p><p class="text-white/45 mt-4">Du hast bereits eine Lizenz? <a href="/de/zugang" class="text-red-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-red-300">Anmelden →</a></p></div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6"><a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/google.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Mit Google fortfahren</a><a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/microsoft.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Mit Microsoft fortfahren</a></div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-white/35 -mt-3 mb-6">Google und Microsoft sind in Vorbereitung. Fülle vorerst die Beta-Anfrage aus.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-7 text-white/35 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></span> Beta-Anfrage <span class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></span></div>
      <div id="request-form" class="scroll-mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.045] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-red-950/10">
        <div data-beta-success hidden class="p-8 sm:p-10 text-center"><div class="mx-auto w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-400/10 border border-green-400/25 flex items-center justify-center text-green-300 mb-5">✓</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] mb-3">Beta-Anfrage gespeichert</h2><p class="text-white/55 leading-[1.6] max-w-[460px] mx-auto">Deine Anfrage ist in der Sténtor-Beta-Warteschlange. Nach der Freigabe zeigt der Kontobereich Lizenz, Downloads und Aktivierungshinweise.</p><a href="/de/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mt-7 h-11 px-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-sm text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors">Zurück zur Seite</a></div>
        <form data-beta-form class="p-6 sm:p-8 grid gap-5" novalidate><div><label class="auth-label" for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="full_name" required type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Ada Lovelace" autocomplete="name" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="email">Berufliche E-Mail</label><input id="email" name="email" required type="email" class="auth-input" placeholder="name@theater.de" autocomplete="email" /></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="auth-label" for="organization">Organisation</label><input id="organization" name="organization_name" required type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Theater, Kompanie, Festival" autocomplete="organization" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="role">Rolle</label><input id="role" name="role" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Produktion, Barrierefreiheit" /></div></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="auth-label" for="country">Land</label><input id="country" name="country" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Deutschland" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="seats">Plätze</label><input id="seats" name="requested_seats" type="number" min="1" value="1" class="auth-input" /></div></div><fieldset class="grid gap-2"><legend class="auth-label">Plattformen</legend><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-white/60"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="macos" checked class="accent-red-500" /> macOS</label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="windows" class="accent-red-500" /> Windows</label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="linux" class="accent-red-500" /> Linux</label></div></fieldset><div><label class="auth-label" for="expected_use">Geplanter Einsatz</label><input id="expected_use" name="expected_use" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Probe, Festival, Barrierefreiheitsprojekt..." /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="message">Wie möchtest du Sténtor nutzen?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" class="auth-input auth-textarea" placeholder="Nenne Produktion, Testzeitraum und gewünschte Konfiguration."></textarea></div><p data-beta-error hidden class="rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 text-red-200 text-sm leading-[1.5] p-4"></p><button type="submit" data-loading-label="Speichern..." class="h-14 rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-black font-semibold text-[15px] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(239,68,68,0.18)] hover:bg-red-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-60">Beta-Zugang anfragen →</button></form>
      </div>
      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-7 text-white/45 text-sm"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Keine Karte erforderlich</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Testlizenz nach Freigabe</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Für Live-Produktion entwickelt</li></ul>
    </main>
  </section>
</Layout>
<script>
  import { setupBetaRequestForm } from '../../lib/betaRequestForm';
  setupBetaRequestForm({ formSelector: '[data-beta-form]', successSelector: '[data-beta-success]', errorSelector: '[data-beta-error]' });
</script>
<style>
  @reference "../../styles/global.css";
  .auth-provider { @apply h-14 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.045] hover:bg-white/[0.075] hover:border-white/20 transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-white/90; }
  .provider-logo { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; display: block; }
  .auth-label { @apply block text-[13px] font-medium text-white/62 mb-2; }
  .auth-input { @apply w-full h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-white outline-none transition-all text-[15px]; padding: 0 16px; }
  .auth-input:focus { border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12); }
  .auth-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.34); }
  .auth-textarea { height: auto; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; resize: none; }
</style>